WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.849 --> 00:00:14.596
The Tang Monk was tied up in a room.

2
00:00:15.577 --> 00:00:17.958
He heard his companions yelling at the monster.

3
00:00:17.978 --> 00:00:21.140
"Hand over the Tang Monk now!"

4
00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:22.360
shouted Bajie.

5
00:00:25.642 --> 00:00:28.324
The Tang Monk heard the sound of weapons clashing.

6
00:00:29.236 --> 00:00:31.118
"I hope they rescue me," said the monk.

7
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.582
A young woman entered the room.

8
00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:38.224
"Wh-who are you?"

9
00:00:38.684 --> 00:00:39.565
asked the Tang Monk.

10
00:00:39.585 --> 00:00:42.808
"I'm a prisoner here," said the woman.

11
00:00:42.828 --> 00:00:47.892
"That monster kidnapped me 13 years ago and won't let me leave.

12
00:00:48.913 --> 00:00:49.774
Will you help me?"

13
00:00:49.794 --> 00:00:53.417
"I wish I could help you," said the Tang Monk.

14
00:00:54.778 --> 00:00:56.760
He showed the young woman his ropes.

15
00:00:57.968 --> 00:01:00.369
"I can help you get free," said the young woman.

16
00:01:00.389 --> 00:01:04.511
"If I do, will you deliver a letter to my parents?"

17
00:01:05.671 --> 00:01:07.072
"Of course," said the monk.

18
00:01:07.092 --> 00:01:08.832
"Who are your parents?"

19
00:01:10.193 --> 00:01:14.715
"They're the king and queen of the Precious Image Kingdom," said the young woman.

20
00:01:14.735 --> 00:01:18.496
"My name is Princess Hundred Flowers."

21
00:01:22.318 --> 00:01:27.280
Bajie and Wujing were still fighting the monster when the princess ran outside.

22
00:01:31.032 --> 00:01:32.734
"Monster!" she cried.

23
00:01:32.754 --> 00:01:35.115
"I must ask you a favor."

24
00:01:36.536 --> 00:01:40.039
Right away the monster stopped fighting and turned to the princess.

25
00:01:40.059 --> 00:01:43.622
"What can I do for you, my sweet?"

26
00:01:44.162 --> 00:01:45.023
asked the monster.

27
00:01:45.043 --> 00:01:48.666
"There's a monk inside," said the princess.

28
00:01:49.627 --> 00:01:52.008
makes me so sad to see him tied up.

29
00:01:52.889 --> 00:01:53.790
Won't you let him go?"

30
00:01:55.271 --> 00:01:56.412
monster hesitated.

31
00:01:58.396 --> 00:02:01.217
"That monk isn't an ordinary monk.

32
00:02:01.797 --> 00:02:06.718
He's Princess Hundred Flowers pretended to cry.

33
00:02:07.779 --> 00:02:09.259
monster held up his hands.

34
00:02:10.179 --> 00:02:11.600
"Okay, okay, sweetie.

35
00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:14.921
know I only want you to be happy.

36
00:02:16.041 --> 00:02:17.241
The monk may go."

37
00:02:18.762 --> 00:02:21.463
The monster followed the princess back inside.

38
00:02:22.363 --> 00:02:25.564
Bajie and Wujing looked at each other in confusion.

39
00:02:26.508 --> 00:02:28.209
"The monster is going to free him?"

40
00:02:28.609 --> 00:02:29.669
mumbled Bajie.

41
00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:34.730
A moment later the Tang Monk came out.

42
00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:40.812
"There's something we must do," he said quietly to his companions.

43
00:02:43.593 --> 00:02:48.054
Later that day the travelers reached the palace of the Precious Image Kingdom.

44
00:02:49.475 --> 00:02:51.595
queen was reading the letter from her daughter.

45
00:02:52.575 --> 00:02:55.124
Tears were in her eyes.

46
00:02:55.665 --> 00:02:57.346
poor daughter," said the queen.

47
00:02:57.366 --> 00:03:00.768
"She's been a prisoner all this time."

48
00:03:01.989 --> 00:03:04.991
The king stood up, his eyes blazing with anger.

49
00:03:07.032 --> 00:03:10.134
He called to his general, who was standing nearby.

50
00:03:10.154 --> 00:03:12.736
"Gather your troops," said the king.

51
00:03:13.617 --> 00:03:14.617
want my daughter back.

52
00:03:15.578 --> 00:03:17.499
And I want that monster destroyed!"

53
00:03:20.021 --> 00:03:22.103
"Forgive me, Your Majesty," said the general.

54
00:03:23.063 --> 00:03:23.864
we are just men.

55
00:03:24.788 --> 00:03:26.890
How can we defeat such a powerful monster?"

56
00:03:28.911 --> 00:03:31.292
"My two companions are powerful spirits, Your Majesty."

57
00:03:31.953 --> 00:03:33.194
Tang Monk spoke up.

58
00:03:33.214 --> 00:03:36.016
"I'm sure they can rescue your daughter."

59
00:03:40.158 --> 00:03:42.940
Soon Bajie and Wujing were back at the pagoda.

60
00:03:45.282 --> 00:03:46.663
pig swung his rake.

61
00:03:49.345 --> 00:03:50.305
The door exploded.

62
00:03:51.446 --> 00:03:53.307
"Get out here, you rotten monster!"

63
00:03:53.647 --> 00:03:54.208
he shouted.

64
00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:56.881
monster ran outside.

65
00:03:56.901 --> 00:03:59.122
"You brutes!"

66
00:03:59.602 --> 00:04:00.902
he yelled.

67
00:04:01.243 --> 00:04:02.843
let the monk go free.

68
00:04:03.643 --> 00:04:05.884
Why did you smash my door down?"

69
00:04:07.205 --> 00:04:09.646
"We're here for the princess," said Wujing.

70
00:04:09.666 --> 00:04:13.007
"The king of the Precious Image Kingdom sent us."

71
00:04:14.928 --> 00:04:18.089
can't take the princess away," said the monster.

72
00:04:18.109 --> 00:04:20.490
"We are in love."

73
00:04:22.271 --> 00:04:23.392
and Wujing attacked.

74
00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:25.982
The monster blocked their weapons.

75
00:04:26.983 --> 00:04:28.625
They fought for over an hour.

76
00:04:32.028 --> 00:04:35.192
Finally Bajie, tired from fighting, turned and ran.

77
00:04:37.094 --> 00:04:37.974
was furious.

78
00:04:37.994 --> 00:04:40.998
"Bajie!" he shouted.

79
00:04:41.018 --> 00:04:43.020
"Where are you—oof!"

80
00:04:44.501 --> 00:04:46.904
The monster knocked out Wujing and tied him up.

81
00:04:50.316 --> 00:04:53.998
He dragged Wujing into the pagoda and locked him in a room.

82
00:04:54.018 --> 00:05:01.060
"The king knows that the princess is here," said the monster to himself.

83
00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:02.981
"But how?"

84
00:05:03.962 --> 00:05:05.862
He tapped his chin and thought.

85
00:05:05.882 --> 00:05:08.764
"Aha!" he said.

86
00:05:08.784 --> 00:05:13.105
"The princess must have asked that monk to go to the king."

87
00:05:14.646 --> 00:05:16.287
eyes became dark and angry.

88
00:05:16.307 --> 00:05:18.448
"She tricked
